  CVE-2026-30252|2026-04-02T21:16:40.490|2026-04-02T21:16:40.490|0.0|NONE|N/A|N/A|false|Multiple reflected cross-site scripting (XSS) vulnerabilities in the login.php endpoint of Interzen Consulting S.r.l ZenShare Suite v17.0 allows attackers to execute arbitrary Javascript in the context of the user's browser via a crafted URL injected into the codice_azienda and red_url parameters.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-30252|0.00000|0.00000|0.0000
