  CVE-2026-32929|2026-04-01T23:17:03.427|2026-04-01T23:17:03.427|8.4|HIGH|CWE-125|N/A|false|V-SFT versions 6.2.10.0 and prior contain an out-of-bounds read in VS6ComFile!get_macro_mem_COM. Opening a crafted V7 file may lead to information disclosure from the affected product.|https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-32929|0.00013|0.02148|5.8804
